{"unit_id":"mayf3__dsh-session-doctor#card-zh","repo":"mayf3/dsh-session-doctor","commit":"8147c144075ad7f7d86541f1393193cf3d522224","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-doctor 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 的会话管理插件，向 DSH 注册五个工具，帮助用户查看和处理同一宿主中的会话。它可以列出会话及标题、工作目录和在线状态，读取用户与助手的对话文本，检查 agent 状态、排队消息数和最近事件；对于正在运行且疑似卡住的 agent，可发送取消信号并保留 inbox 排队消息。用户也可以向其他会话发送消息，在线会话直接接收，持久化会话会先恢复再投递。适合需要检查多个 DSH 会话状态、恢复卡住工作或查看进度的场景。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:43-226"]}
{"unit_id":"mayf3__dsh-session-doctor#card-en","repo":"mayf3/dsh-session-doctor","commit":"8147c144075ad7f7d86541f1393193cf3d522224","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-doctor is a DeepSeek Harness plugin with five tools to list sessions, read conversations, inspect agent status, recover stalled work while keeping queued messages, and message live or resumed sessions.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:43-226"]}
